  triage:title "run_admission_capacity.py re-declares constants already owned by admission_capacity_support.py before importing from it" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr BB3-QA-R5-1789273000 (ARCH-002, arch-qa, independently confirmed), PR #1463 comment (fix/bb3-qa4-r5 @ 5da523f81), verdict FAIL, 2026-09-13T01:11:21Z. scripts/smoke/run_admission_capacity.py:26-28,73 re-declares ROOT, DEFAULT_EVIDENCE_DIR, DEFAULT_RAW_EVIDENCE_DIR, DEFAULT_WORKERS with identical values to admission_capacity_support.py before a later explicit import block from the same module -- reintroducing the exact drift risk BB3-022 was raised to eliminate. Ruled genuine by fenix." ;
